flowchart TB
    subgraph Governance ["Community Governance (veESVL)"]
        G1[ESVL Holders] -->|Lock Tokens| G2[veESVL<br/>Vote-Escrowed]
        G2 --> G3[Proposal Submission]
        G3 --> G4{Voting<br/>Quorum ≥ 10%<br/>Approval ≥ 67%}
        G4 -->|Pass| G5[Timelock<br/>48h Delay]
        G5 --> G6[Execute via<br/>DiamondCutFacet]
        G4 -->|Fail| G7[Archive]
    end

    subgraph Proposals ["Proposal Types"]
        P1[Asset Approval<br/>New RWA listing]
        P2[Protocol Upgrade<br/>Add/Replace Facets]
        P3[Parameter Change<br/>Fees, thresholds]
        P4[Treasury Allocation<br/>Grants, bounties]
        P5[Verifier Election<br/>Add/Remove verifiers]
        P6[Emergency Action<br/>Pause, forced transfer]
    end

    subgraph Verifiers ["Asset Verification Network"]
        V1[Apply as Verifier<br/>Stake 50K ESVL] --> V2[Community Vote<br/>Approval]
        V2 --> V3[Active Verifier<br/>Earn fees per verification]
        V3 --> V4[Slash on<br/>Misbehavior]
    end

    P1 & P2 & P3 & P4 & P5 & P6 --> G3
    G6 -->|Asset Approval| V3

    style G4 fill:#1A1A1A,stroke:#fff,color:#fff
    style G6 fill:#2D2D2D,stroke:#fff,color:#fff
